{"id":"u-9d3424c9-1959-478b-a395-96d00510e252","src":"community","title":"T-Shirt Bulk: Chest, Shoulders & Arms","author":"Rory M.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/Duj37N-bad-wrist-spondylolisthesis-1","desc":"A 12-week hypertrophy block for lifters who want to look bigger in a t-shirt: chest, side delts and arms get priority volume and are pushed hardest, while back, legs and abs are maintained. Designed for a home gym with a rack, barbell, adjustable bench, single cable pulley and dumbbells.\nThe engine is progressive overload: log every set and aim to beat last week by a rep or a small weight increase, keeping priority lifts 1–3 reps from failure. Lower-day work uses back-friendly movements (box squats, RDLs, tempo squats) and abs are always sequenced at the end of sessions. Single-arm cable work lets you start with your weaker side to fix imbalances. Two optional cardio sessions per week slot alongside the lifting. Deload after the block.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":40,"joins":12,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-15T14:18:08.510Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper 1 - Chest & Shoulders","Upper 2 - Back, Traps & Biceps","Lowers","Upper 3 - Chest & Arms","Upper 4 - Delts, Back & Arms"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}],"note":"Single-Arm, KNEELING"},{"n":"Seated Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}],"note":"NEUTRAL GRIP"},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":4}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Ab Wheel","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Shrug (Trap Bar)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Bayesian Curl","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hanging Leg Raise","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}